<title>USA: Omaha cattle fully steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha cattle fully steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Slaughter steers and heifers were fairly active, traded fully steady.</p>
<p>Steers - select to mostly choice 2-4 1100-1300 lbs 66.50-67.50. Select 64.00-66.00.</p>
<p>Heifers - select to largely choice 2-4 975-1200 lbs 66.00-67.50. Select 63.00-65.50.</p>
</text>
